<title>USA: Boehringer Mannheim unit gets FDA ok for retavase.</title>
<headline>Boehringer Mannheim unit gets FDA ok for retavase.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boehringer Mannheim Corp's Therapeutics Division said on Wednesday that it received clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market Retavase to treat heart attack patients.</p>
</text>
